@FG-M1-2a030a5f1e CORRECT conf=H cls=CLASSIFICATION neg=PERMISSION_REMOVES_OBLIGATION
why: Not a requirement to create every optional directory removes an obligation and prohibits nothing. An agent that creates an optional directory immediately breaks no part of this sentence. The stored MUST_NOT and its rationale, optional directories only when needed, read in an only-when that this line does not contain. That wording sits at backend-layout.md:112. The oracle already allows not creating the directory, so C6 makes this non-normative. This rests on the frozen protocol, not on PI-012. The neighbouring slnx sentence belongs to another claim.
